Undo a correction using its returned token, preserving newer edits

Usage: mxr todo undo-correction [OPTIONS] <TODO_ID> <CORRECTION_ID>

Arguments:
  <TODO_ID>
  <CORRECTION_ID>

Options:
      --dry-run
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
